{"id":202,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"国際感覚と自主性を育てる専大松戸の教育","feature_description":"専修大学松戸中学校は「報恩奉仕」「質実剛健」「誠実力行」を校訓とし、社会に貢献できる知性豊かな人材の育成を目指します。教育ビジョンでは、広い視野と国際感覚、自主性・行動力、他者への温かさと批判的思考を重視しています。学習や国際理解・英語教育を通じて、考え判断し行動する力を伸ばす方針を掲げています。知性と情操の両面を育てることも目標としています。","clubs":[{"id":4529,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4530,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4531,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4532,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4533,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4534,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4535,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4536,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4537,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4538,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4539,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4541,"name":"コンピューター部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.senshu-u-matsudo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4542,"name":"合唱部